# Chess Game Console Application

A modular Chess Game built in C# using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles and designed with custom UML architecture.

## Features
- **Object-Oriented Architecture:** Designed using clean OOP principles (Inheritance, Polymorphism, Abstraction).
- **Move Validation:** Standard movement rules for chess pieces (Pawn, Rook, Knight, Bishop, Queen, King).
- **Interactive CLI:** Playable directly from the console window.
- **Extensible Codebase:** Structured to allow future updates like AI opponents or GUI integration.

## Tech Stack
- **Language:** C#
- **Framework:** .NET / Visual Studio
- **Design Tools:** Draw.io (UML Diagrams)
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

